// ⚠️ NOT THE ACTIVE DEPLOYMENT PATH — CONFIRMED (2026-07):
// This site's live production deployment is Cloudflare PAGES via Git
// integration (auto-deploy on GitHub push). This wrangler.jsonc file,
// and the "deploy:cf-workers" / "preview:cf-workers" scripts in
// package.json, are OPTIONAL manual tooling for Cloudflare Workers
// (wrangler deploy) - a completely separate deployment mechanism that
// is NOT used for the live site. "assets.html_handling" below ONLY
// affects requests served via `wrangler deploy` (Workers Static
// Assets); it has ZERO effect on the actual Cloudflare Pages
// Git-integration deployment that serves www.walakatha.net.
//
// "pages_build_output_dir" exists purely to satisfy Cloudflare Pages'
// build-time config scanner, which otherwise logs a (non-fatal,
// build-continuing) validation warning on every build when it finds a
// wrangler config file that lacks this key. It has no effect on the
// real Pages deployment (driven by the Cloudflare dashboard's own
// build settings) and does not change `wrangler deploy` behavior for
// the manual Workers testing scripts above, which continue to use the
// "assets" block as before.
{
  "name": "walakatha",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-03-01",
  "pages_build_output_dir": "./dist",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page",
    "html_handling": "force-trailing-slash"
  }
}
